High-Performance Material Requirements: Demand for materials combining rubber-like elasticity with thermoplastic processability is supporting adoption across diverse industrial applications.

SEPS Thermoplastic Elastomer Watch: Automotive and Specialty Applications
SEPS combines the elasticity of rubber with the processing advantages of thermoplastics. Its resistance to heat and chemicals, tensile performance, and flexibility make it attractive for applications including adhesives, automotive components, medical products, electronics, and cosmetics.

